{# "Recordarme": asked on the device that is about to sign in, right above the button that does it, so
   the choice is seen before pressing and lands on the device it is about. Unticked on purpose: a
   shared staff-room computer must keep the idle timeout unless someone asks otherwise. #}
<label class="choice auth-remember"><input type="checkbox" name="_remember_me" value="1" aria-describedby="remember-me-hint"> Recordarme en este dispositivo</label>
<p class="auth-hint" id="remember-me-hint">Seguirás dentro 30 días. No lo marques en un ordenador compartido.</p>
